# Who the dashboard shows is whoever signs in. On a seeded backend (npm run db:seed) that is
# alice@pulsars.local / password123 (patient id 2); anyone can also create a patient account.

# Where the API lives. "/api" is forwarded to the backend by the Vite dev server
# (see vite.config.ts). Set a full URL (and enable CORS on the backend) to bypass that.
VITE_API_URL=/api
